THIRD-PARTY CHARTS REDISTRIBUTED IN THIS PACKAGE

`helm package -u` vendors each chart dependency that `Chart.yaml` declares into
`charts/`, so every published `platform-<version>.tgz` carries their source. No
packaged upstream chart includes its own LICENSE file, so each licence text is
copied into `LICENSES/<name>-LICENSE` from the upstream repository at the tag
that matches the pinned version. No upstream repository has a NOTICE file at
that tag (checked 2026-11-03).

Each entry below gives the chart name, the pinned version, the licence, the
source of the licence text, the file that holds it and the SHA-256 of that file.
`includes` names the charts vendored inside that chart that come from the same
upstream repository and so are under the same licence. `inside` names the
chart that vendors an entry with a licence of its own.
`scripts/tests/test_licenses.py` fails when this file, `Chart.yaml`,
`LICENSES/` and the vendored charts disagree.

